# Build context hygiene for the extended OpenClaw image.
#
# plugins/lightbulb-marketplace is COPY'd wholesale into /app/dist/extensions/, and
# it carries a local node_modules for building + testing (its `openclaw`
# devDependency alone is ~460MB of plugin-SDK types). None of that belongs in
# the image: the plugin ships only its committed dist/, resolving
# openclaw/plugin-sdk and typebox from the host at /app.
#
# Scoped to plugins/ rather than a bare **/node_modules so this cannot quietly
# change what any other COPY in the Dockerfile picks up.
plugins/*/node_modules/
